<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the party picker area name. Each module can have its own area
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Note that <b>SetPartyPickerStage</b> only works in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/EVENT%20TYPE%20MODULE%20GETCHARSTAGE" title="EVENT TYPE MODULE GETCHARSTAGE">GETCHARSTAGE</a> module event. It does not replace the default <b>char_stage</b> but loads an overlaying area. <a rel="nofollow" class="external autonumber" href="http://social.bioware.com/forum/1/topic/71/index/1436426#1446802">[1]</a> <a rel="nofollow" class="external autonumber" href="http://social.bioware.com/forum/1/topic/71/index/1436426#1521790">[2]</a>
</p>
